# The Actions secret HELD_CONTENT_RULES, pinned: `<sha256-hex> <row count>`. The digest is of the
# secret's text with CRLF turned into LF and exactly one final newline
# (.github/held/held_content_scan.py, load_detectors). Both numbers are checked before anything is
# scanned, and a mismatch is exit 2, never a pass: a secret that was edited outside a pull request
# is a change to what this repository checks for, made where nobody reviews it.
#
# To change the private table: set the secret and change this line in the SAME pull request, which
# a code owner approves because .github/ is theirs.
6132d36b04af67bbf4e6bf62254127704ff82dc506fa9753c887adeb4bc2f1f4 10
